;\">While OPEN nothing is consumed and no attempts burn; the store waits on disk.</span></p>", "tid": null, "valign": "middle", "vposition": "none", "hposition": "none"}}, "children": [], "layerId": "layer0"}, {"x": 45, "y": 1101.0, "rotation": 0, "id": 271, "width": 502.99999999999994, "height": 18, "uid": "com.gliffy.shape.basic.basic_v1.default.text", "order": 195, "lockAspectRatio": false, "lockShape": false, "graphic": {"type": "Text", "Text": {"overflow": "none", "paddingTop": 2, "paddingRight": 2, "paddingBottom": 2, "paddingLeft": 2, "outerPaddingTop": 0, "outerPaddingRight": 0, "outerPaddingBottom": 0, "outerPaddingLeft": 0, "type": "fixed", "lineTValue": null, "linePerpValue": null, "cardinalityType": null, "html": "<p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-family:Arial;\">firstSeenAt comes from the Kafka timestamp, so restarts never extend the 4h deadline.</span></p>", "tid": null, "valign": "middle", "vposition": "none", "hposition": "none"}}, "children": [], "layerId": "layer0"}, {"x": 45, "y": 1121.0, "rotation": 0, "id": 272, "width": 555.1999999999999, "height": 18, "uid": "com.gliffy.shape.basic.basic_v1.default.text", "order": 196, "lockAspectRatio": false, "lockShape": false, "graphic": {"type": "Text", "Text": {"overflow": "none", "paddingTop": 2, "paddingRight": 2, "paddingBottom": 2, "paddingLeft": 2, "outerPaddingTop": 0, "outerPaddingRight": 0, "outerPaddingBottom": 0, "outerPaddingLeft": 0, "type": "fixed", "lineTValue": null, "linePerpValue": null, "cardinalityType": null, "html": "<p style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-family:Arial;\">Store keys stay topic-partition-offset for the whole lifecycle; changelog restores on restart.</span></p>", "tid": null, "valign": "middle", "vposition": "none", "hposition": "none"}}, "children": [], "layerId": "layer0"}, {"x": 800.0, "y": 1205.0, "rotation": 0, "id": 273, "width": 16.0, "height": 16.0, "uid": "com.gliffy.shape.basic.basic_v1.default.round_recta